# Tailwind v4

- CSS-first: define design tokens with `@theme` in `globals.css` (or equivalent global CSS).
- **No** `tailwind.config.js` / `tailwind.config.ts`.
- **No** `@tailwind base|components|utilities` directives — use the v4 import/`@theme` setup already in the project.
- Prefer tokenized colors/type from `docs/design.md` over one-off hex in components when tokens exist.
- Do not introduce a second styling system alongside Tailwind + CSS variables.
